                {
                    "id": "710081301",
                    "speaker": "小姜",
                    "text": "#这样也找不到吗，{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}是不是不太擅长这种游戏啊…"
