                },
                {
                    "id": "710081703",
                    "speaker": "小姜",
                    "text": "#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}你肯定没我爸爸厉害，我就提示你一下好了，我就藏<color=#00E1FFFF>那边的屋子周围</color>喔。"
